Value Filldown SLOT (\d+)
Value Required POWER_ID (\d+)
Value STATUS (\S+)
Value MODE (\S+)
Value CURRENT (\S+)
Value VOLTAGE (\S+)
Value POWER_W (\S+)
Value AIRFLOW (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Device\s+Info\s+on\s+Slot\s+${SLOT}:\s*$$ -> DeviceTable
  ^\s*Slot\s+${SLOT}: -> Power

DeviceTable
  ^\s*Device\s+ID\.\s+Status\s*$$
  ^\s*${POWER_ID}\s+${STATUS}\s*$$ -> Record DeviceTable
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*

Power
  ^\s*Input\s+Power:
  ^\s*PowerID\s+State\s+Mode
  ^\s*${POWER_ID}\s+${STATUS}\s+${MODE}\s+${CURRENT}\s+${VOLTAGE}\s+${POWER_W}\s+${AIRFLOW}\s*$$ -> Record
